<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - USLIFE cut by Schroder.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - USLIFE cut by Schroder.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim analyst Andrew Kligerman said he lowered his rating on USLIFE Corp to neutral from outperform, citing gains in stock price after he upgraded it in mid-January.</p>
<p>-- Said he had upgraded stock on potential for takeover at a value of at least $44 a share.</p>
<p>-- With stock at 41-3/4 at Tuesday's close, said he downgraded the stock on absence of takeover news and the potential for no deal to emerge.</p>
<p>-- USLIFE down 5/8 to 40-7/8 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
